[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3960.15, "timestamp": "01:06:00", "text": "然后我突然意识到，哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3962.39, "timestamp": "01:06:02", "text": "我们打算买个贵点的麦克风。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.23, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "这就是那一刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3969.829, "timestamp": "01:06:09", "text": "就是我之前说的那个咖啡玩意儿。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3973.349, "timestamp": "01:06:13", "text": "这就是我想买的麦克风。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3975.91, "timestamp": "01:06:15", "text": "也就是 45k。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3978.71, "timestamp": "01:06:18", "text": "但是，如果我能买到，岂不是更好吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3980.95, "timestamp": "01:06:20", "text": "又是它？我可以再次购买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3989.99, "timestamp": "01:06:29", "text": "所以，我考虑过要么选择……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3994.15, "timestamp": "01:06:34", "text": "优雅的。我的天哪，现在要999美元了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3996.789, "timestamp": "01:06:36", "text": "我真希望我有钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4000.069, "timestamp": "01:06:40", "text": "比如，如果它是你可以购买的产品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4003.349, "timestamp": "01:06:43", "text": "两次，就值了，对吧？如果这是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4006.069, "timestamp": "01:06:46", "text": "就是那种你买不到的产品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4008.549, "timestamp": "01:06:48", "text": "你买一次就不能再买了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4011.43, "timestamp": "01:06:51", "text": "那也是痛苦，对吧？尤其"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4014.15, "timestamp": "01:06:54", "text": "这个24到40赫兹的显示器之类的东西。我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4018.309, "timestamp": "01:06:58", "text": "再次购买时，就缺货了。"}]